# Static deploy hints for admin.theloop-app.com (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify / Render Static)

Build: `npm ci && npm run build`
Publish directory: `dist`

Environment (build-time):
- VITE_SUPABASE_URL
- VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
- VITE_API_URL=https://api.theloop-app.com

DNS: CNAME `admin` → pages host
CORS on API must include https://admin.theloop-app.com
